<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  8.27%			C/S =  1.90%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  9.33%			O/N =  2.54% (Discount)</p>
<p>	    T/N =  5.09%			T/N =  5.08%</p>
<p>		   Jan  31, 1997			Jan 30, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  4.07%	1 month forward =  3.73%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  5.43%	2 month forward =  5.43%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.44%	3 month forward =  6.79%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.70%	4 month forward =  6.79%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.05%	5 month forward =  7.06%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.19%	6 month forward =  7.20%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
